<title>USA: Concepts Direct sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Concepts Direct sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>LONGMONT, Colo. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Concepts Direct Inc said Tuesday it has set a two-for-one split of its common stock.</p>
<p>The split is payable March 31 to shareholders of record at the close of business on March 14.</p>
<p>Following the split, the company will have about 4,250,882 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Concepts sells personalized paper products and a variety of merchandise.</p>
</text>
